      "description": "Pill track with a sliding thumb in the button color.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-seg\"><span class=\"ds-th\"></span><span class=\"ds-sl on\">Pay Period</span><span class=\"ds-sl\">All</span></div>",
      "css": ":host{--ranch-ground:#F5EFFA;--ranch-page:#FFFCFF;--ranch-page2:#F0E8F8;--ranch-line:#E0D3EE;--ranch-track:#E7DCF3;--ranch-ink:#2B1A4F;--ranch-ink2:#5B4A7F;--ranch-btn-bg:#3A2466;--ranch-btn-fg:#FFFFFF;--ranch-btn-sh:rgb(58 36 102 / .32);--ranch-focus:#B1335F;--ranch-focus-bg:#FBE4EC;--ranch-ok-ink:#1D6A45;--ranch-ok-bg:#D6F1E1;--ranch-soon-ink:#694700;--ranch-soon-bg:#FBE9AE;--ranch-fill:#7B58C9;--ranch-sh:rgb(70 40 130 / .16);--ranch-plank:#84593F;--ranch-plank-ink:#FFF5EC;--ranch-ring:#2B1A4F} .ds-seg{position:relative;display:inline-grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;padding:4px;border-radius:999px;background:var(--ranch-track)} .ds-th{position:absolute;inset:0 auto 0 0;width:50%;border-radius:999px;background:var(--ranch-btn-bg);box-shadow:0 6px 12px -8px var(--ranch-btn-sh)} .ds-sl{position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:40px;padding:0 16px;font:600 15px/1 Fredoka,sans-serif;color:var(--ranch-ink2);white-space:nowrap} .ds-sl.on{color:var(--ranch-btn-fg)}"
    },
